{"id": "EUVD-2026-86153", "enisaUuid": "d68565f6-0c5c-3be8-acdc-d2bd00666259", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: rtw89: fix HE extended capability length check\n\nrtw89_mac_check_he_obss_narrow_bw_ru_iter() reads extended capability\nbyte 10, but rejects only datalen values below 10.  Byte 10 requires at\nleast 11 bytes.\n\nRequire datalen >= 11 before reading data[10].", "datePublished": "2026-09-24T15:52:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:08:35", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eddf53f1edb0cf7f302bd15cdb47cca90948c205", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/655c4401c18d735dbaf2cc172ff4f626b3a896a0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bddbd1de765bf6ddc0473ad683910eb3a2a92a43", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f2a01deff7d0d5cc3dcbf2358dac113979303c8e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f132fc01b359a0f7d81fe13d769ea4e7c4baa66e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2aba608a86e9b099c9af2ea70b620552dee2b628"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-93281", "GHSA-fc4w-fg4f-8x55"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "23f0ed60-96ac-30a3-9980-b15e98c5ecc5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8d540f9d29162e273797bef36686a010724f0f8a <f132fc01b359a0f7d81fe13d769ea4e7c4baa66e"}, {"id": "30d06c24-8a70-3fa5-af02-5c6e939afd5f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.1"}, {"id": "3c81ad99-e8cf-34d3-9262-59d98e26ad45", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.157"}, {"id": "610e4b07-d5f9-3a19-8111-061a0e81965b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "64b6e681-2bc0-3008-8aa8-ffeed4376ab7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "65c6428e-5e7a-3bae-a81b-76ed7853e111", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_ve